OVERVIEW: Firmware pipeline: prepare (download/merge IPSWs) and patch

USAGE: vphone-cli fw <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  catalog                 Show the known iOS ↔ cloudOS firmware pairings
                          (recommended per iOS build)
  prepare                 Download + merge IPSWs into a VM bundle
  patch                   Patch the boot chain (native Swift FirmwarePipeline)
  record                  Inspect patch experiment records written by
                          --record-out
  inspect                 Read a local IPSW BuildManifest without extracting
                          firmware
  plan                    Resolve and print the declared patch plan for a
                          variant (read-only; patches nothing)
  cache                   List the shared IPSW cache, or adopt an entry that
                          has no completion marker
  selection-preview       Preview legacy patch ID and bundled preset migration
                          (read-only JSON)
  selection-migrate       Preview or atomically migrate an explicit upstream
                          PatchSelection.plist

  See 'vphone-cli help fw <subcommand>' for detailed help.
